WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:03,550
Brother Ling

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,450
I watched your performance in Star Fighter

3
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:08,010
Your mutation step is extremely powerful

4
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,420
I really need your melee explosive power.

5
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:14,980
As long as you join the alliance

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,420
Your settlement expenses will increase tenfold to one hundred million

7
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:20,220
And all the loot after capturing the Demon God drama point

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:29,710
Sorry, I asked you to choose the three swords first, Chu Shang

9
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:34,320
I appreciate your kindness and you also said so

10
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,040
I follow the waste-head mutation stream

11
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,560
My troops are all brainless monsters bleeding out.

12
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:42,160
Once you become red-eyed on the battlefield,

13
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,440
They even ate friendly troops

14
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,960
If I get mixed up with your large army,

15
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,560
I'm afraid I can't control my monster

16
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,520
Treat your family members as enemies.

17
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:55,540
It won’t be good if you hurt your harmony by then.

18
00:00:56,290 --> 00:00:57,250
For everyone's safety

19
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:58,770
It's better for me to act alone

20
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:00,700
I wish you all a prosperous Shen Yun
